$$
\frac{S_n}{T_n} = \frac{2n}{3n + 1}
$$

So:

$$
\frac{2a_1 + (n - 1)d}{2b_1 + (n - 1)e} = \frac{2n}{3n + 1} \quad \text{(3)}
$$

---

